OL,3,GNEWSAThieves ram garden centre gates in
OL,4,Agetaway car
OL,5,
OL,6,FThieves stole a tipper truck and then
OL,7,Flater fled from police by ramming a car
OL,8,Fthrough the gates of a garden centre,
OL,9,Fpolice have said.
OL,11,FThe truck and a quantity of diesel were
OL,12,Ftaken from a business premises on
OL,13,FSpalding Road, in Bourne, just before
OL,14,Fmidnight on Friday, Lincolnshire Police
OL,15,Fsaid.
OL,17,FAbout two hours later, police found the
OL,18,Fwhite Peugeot truck in a barn off Fen
OL,19,FRoad in Ruskington.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
